Name: sasl_option
Type: STRING
Default-Value: NULL
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED
For-Documentation-Only: 1

If cyrus-imapd is linked with libsasl2, then any `SASL option`_ can be set by
prefixing it with ``sasl_``.  Options set in this way take precedence over
those set in the libsasl2 configuration file.

Otherwise, only the SASL options explicitly documented here are used.

.. _SASL option: https://www.cyrusimap.org/sasl/sasl/options.html
